	(text "UART header (DNP): flash/monitor with an external 3.3 V USB-serial\nadapter if the onboard CP2102N misbehaves. Unplug USB-C first.\nAdapter TX -> U0RXD, adapter RX <- U0TXD. 3V3 pin: power in OR out,\nnot both. EN/IO0 for manual or DTR/RTS-driven reset."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
